WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.700
Feel like you've seen Mandy from Young Sheldon&nbsp;
before? Maybe you've seen her in other sitcoms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.360
or kids movies, or even a few sitcoms for kids.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:14.520
In Season 5 of Young Sheldon, viewers&nbsp;
were first introduced to Mandy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.880
a 30-year-old woman who meets&nbsp;
Sheldon Cooper's older brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:22.054
Georgie at the laundromat owned by&nbsp;
the boys' fun-loving grandmother.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:24.480
While it definitely wasn't love at first sight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.140
their relationship matures and&nbsp;
Mandy eventually becomes pregnant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:33.660
which adds a fun dramatic flare to the sitcom&nbsp;
prequel. Mandy quickly becomes part of the family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:39.240
with their daughter Constance, who was named&nbsp;
after Sheldon and Georgie's "Meemaw," Connie.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.140
Before taking on the role of the&nbsp;
quick-witted Mandy on Young Sheldon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.880
Emily Osment — the younger sister of The&nbsp;
Sixth Sense star Haley Joel Osment — was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.720
featured in a few other sitcoms and&nbsp;
even a series of action-packed films.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:56.220
While she also appeared in her share of&nbsp;
dramatic projects, her performance as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:00.900
Mandy showcases the comedic acting chops&nbsp;
she's been developing since her youth.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:07.020
Some of her earliest roles were guest appearances&nbsp;
on 3rd Rock from the Sun and Friends. Her first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:12.360
truly notable role was in the original Spy Kids&nbsp;
film series, where she portrayed Gerti Giggles.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.797 --> 00:01:18.300
Rocking unforgettable helicopter pigtails that&nbsp;
allowed the youngster to fly. Gerti debuted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:24.840
in Spy Kids 2: Island of Lost Dreams, as the&nbsp;
super-spy younger sister of the antagonistic Gary.

00:01:25.123 --> 00:01:31.980
She starts as a competitive villain and possible&nbsp;
love interest for protagonist Juni Cortez before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:37.500
eventually seeing the corruption within her own&nbsp;
family. Osment returned as Gerti for Spy Kids 3:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.400
Game Over, where her fantastical&nbsp;
hairstyle made a fabulous comeback.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.824 --> 00:01:46.140
She appeared to encourage Juni to take up&nbsp;
the family business as an agent once again.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:51.060
You might also recognize Osment from her&nbsp;
role as Lilly Truscott on the smash hit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.500
series Hannah Montana. The show became a&nbsp;
worldwide sensation with Osment playing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.120
the best friend of pop superstar Hannah&nbsp;
Montana. Osment's superb sense of comedic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:04.860
timing shines through as she plays off&nbsp;
series lead Miley Cyrus in a plethora&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:09.180
of laughable situations. She even gets&nbsp;
a chance to play a heightened version of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:14.940
her character through the clownish alter-ego,&nbsp;
Lola, wearing a variety of bob-cut, neon wigs.

00:02:15.236 --> 00:02:18.720
The chemistry between the two&nbsp;
young stars helped propel Hannah&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:22.080
Montana to extraordinary success. Coincidentally,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:26.940
the two even had their own guest-starring&nbsp;
roles on the raunchy comedy Two and a Half Men.

00:02:27.325 --> 00:02:32.640
Emily Osment showed off her goofier side in the&nbsp;
coming-of-age hit Young &amp; Hungry, as the striving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:38.400
personal chef Gabi Diamond. Contrary to her last&nbsp;
name, things don't always go as smoothly as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:44.040
youthful cook would like, leading to a series&nbsp;
of memorable antics. Young &amp; Hungry highlights&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:49.920
the best qualities of Osment's acting history&nbsp;
with slapstick comedy, sarcastic comebacks, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:55.740
relatable young adult situations as she navigates&nbsp;
life in San Francisco with her zany friends.

00:02:56.318 --> 00:03:01.500
The sitcom was a fresh start for ABC Family as&nbsp;
it transitioned into the trendy Freeform network.&nbsp;

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:06.180
The forward-thinking series helped shift&nbsp;
the landscape towards the new vision with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:12.480
fellow former Disney Channel star Ashley Tisdale&nbsp;
occupying both a producer role and a recurring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:17.280
part as a guest star in the series. The two&nbsp;
even shared a few ridiculous scenes together.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.400
"My mom used to do this to&nbsp;
me when I talked too much."&nbsp;

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.960
"I just wanted to change the subject."
"Mom never did that."

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.920
Osment also lent her talents to the&nbsp;
heartwarming Netflix comedy Pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:34.740
Smart as the snarky brainiac Chelsea. Fans&nbsp;
may even see shades of Sheldon Cooper here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:40.440
as her character is extremely similar.&nbsp;
Osment stars as Claire's rigid older sister,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.783
who moves in with her and&nbsp;
her friends in Los Angeles.

00:03:43.783 --> 00:03:48.540
The show cleverly balances Chelsea's&nbsp;
overachieving academic life with her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:53.400
sister's more carefree attitude. At first,&nbsp;
the two seemingly couldn't be more different,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:58.260
before they inevitably discover their&nbsp;
similarities and grow closer as sisters.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:04.320
Osment's knack for snarky remarks comes in handy&nbsp;
here as she adapts to the influencer's paradise;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:10.800
she also captures her character's kinder moments&nbsp;
with authenticity. She even has a romantic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:15.840
will-they-won't-they relationship with previous&nbsp;
Disney Channel star Gregg Sulkin's character,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:21.240
Grant, which gives Pretty Smart an added&nbsp;
dose of nostalgia fans will surely enjoy.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.580
Unfortunately, the cozy and colorful&nbsp;
series was canceled after only one season,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:30.600
though you can still visit this&nbsp;
heartfelt tale anytime on Netflix.

